WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
All four AI assistants
ranked Levoit first.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.940
But in the open
recommendation prompt,

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.760
two picked Carepod instead.

4
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.380
Same shopper. Same winter bedroom.

5
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.160
The ranking prompt asked
for a brand comparison.

6
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.680
The discovery prompt asked
for a recommendation.

7
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.860
In discovery, ChatGPT
and Perplexity picked Carepod.

8
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.500
Claude picked Levoit.

9
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.740
Gemini led with Dreo
as its best overall value.

10
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.460
Add an under-$100 budget,
and three led with Levoit.

11
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:29.760
Claude called Dreo its best match.

12
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.360
Levoit appeared in all 12 answers.

13
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.100
Last time, it also appeared in all 12,

14
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.600
but ranked first in only
two of four comparisons.

15
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.880
Track visibility and first choice
for each prompt.

16
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.460
These are captured November 25 answers.

17
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:46.320
We didn’t verify prices or test the products.

18
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.240
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
